{"id":"a74a9caa29e2a312","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-fixed-point-theorem.md","title":"Modal Fixed Point Theorem","display":"thm-fixed-point-theorem — Modal Fixed Point Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem","aliases":["89-thm-fixed-point-theorem"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-theorem — Modal Fixed Point Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","[[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]]","[[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-fixed-point-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-fixed-point-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-theorem — Modal Fixed Point Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02536e2efd437c59\" href=\"?note=02536e2efd437c59\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point-modal\">89-df-fixed-point-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ba460c900107e00\" href=\"?note=4ba460c900107e00\" title=\"89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound\">89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"426d9ae12ef39fe8\" href=\"?note=426d9ae12ef39fe8\" title=\"89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence\">89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是既有不动点集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是出现字母集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}\">\\(\\mathrm{md}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{\\Box}\">\\(b_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是度数和不同盒子公式数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 为 dotted box。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{md}(H)\\le b_{\\Box}(A)\n\\land(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{md}(H)\\le b_{\\Box}(A)\n\\land(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104、114–116；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>取 character 算法构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span>。度数界定理给原书加强等价、字母界及度数界；弱/加强等价使它属于原有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MFix}\">\\(\\mathrm{MFix}\\)</span>。这保留此前存在性及加强等价结论，并补上第 8 章第二种证明的构造、直接依赖和度数界。它是有逐节点证明的 Markdown 形式化；未宣称已在 Coq/Rocq/Lean 中编译。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point-modal","status":"resolved","id":"02536e2efd437c59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound","status":"resolved","id":"4ba460c900107e00","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal M_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{md}","display":false},{"tex":"b_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{MFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\;\n\\left[\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{md}(H)\\le b_{\\Box}(A)\n\\land(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"H_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MFix}","display":false}],"bytes":1555,"backlinks":[{"id":"d02a2af901e8720d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般有限构造：[[89-df-modal-degree]] → [[89-df-modal-characters]] → [[89-lem-modal-character-partition]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound]] → [[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["02536e2efd437c59","4ba460c900107e00","426d9ae12ef39fe8"]}